('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',6,'Gather it all into a ball without kneading.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',7,'Wrap in cling wrap and chip for at least an hour.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',8,'When chilled - roll pastry and cover a 9-inch quiche pan (as shown in the video).'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',9,'Chill the pastry for 15 minutes, and'),
