('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',15,'Set aside to cool.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',16,'Core and cut the peppers in half.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',17,'Place them on a baking tray skin side up.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',18,'Brush with remaining olive oil.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',19,'Bake at 220 C/ 440 F for 15 to 20 minutes or until skin is charred.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',20,'Cover with foil for 10 minutes then remove skin and chop roughly.'),
('Caramelized_Onions_Roasted_Red_Peppers_Quiche',21,'Set aside.'),
