('Chicken_Shawarma_Recipe',8,'Then, reduce heat to medium-high.'),
('Chicken_Shawarma_Recipe',9,'Cook chicken for about 4 to 5 minutes on each side.'),
('Chicken_Shawarma_Recipe',10,'Remove from heat and let rest for minutes.'),
('Chicken_Shawarma_Recipe',11,'Serve with side salad and tahini over flatbread or pita.'),
('Chicken_Shawarma_Recipe',12,'In a bowl, add the tahini paste, garlic, salt, pepper, and lemon juice.'),
