('Chicken_and_Broccoli_Zucchini_Noodle_Stir_Fry',2,'Use a paper towel to remove any excess moisture from the chicken breasts.'),
('Chicken_and_Broccoli_Zucchini_Noodle_Stir_Fry',3,'Cut chicken into thin slices.'),
('Chicken_and_Broccoli_Zucchini_Noodle_Stir_Fry',4,'Add the sliced chicken pieces and give it a good mix so each piece is well coated in the marinade.'),
('Chicken_and_Broccoli_Zucchini_Noodle_Stir_Fry',5,'Leave this for at least 10 minutes while you prepare everything else. You can also marinate for an hour or more in the fridge.'),
('Chicken_and_Broccoli_Zucchini_Noodle_Stir_Fry',6,'Wash and chop Broccoli. Drain any excess water. Keep any extra stems separate so you can use them.'),
('Chicken_and_Broccoli_Zucchini_Noodle_Stir_Fry',7,'Cut the onion into thick slices and separate the layers.');
